ull, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 17310, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01XYaePZ9onepPiwborwMASd", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19823, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01MqjfQeQMVqU54n1ftaqoD3", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy - rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). Actions taken: rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0, the most recent production release that was healthy (v2.3.1-rc was only in staging and was also unhealthy). The first rollback attempt halted with a partial failure after us-east (orchestrator error), leaving us-east on v2.3.0 and us-west/eu-west on v2.3.1. I retried the rollback to v2.3.0, which completed in all regions. Current state: us-east, us-west, eu-west all on v2.3.0, healthy=true, error rate 0.002. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure root cause and the orchestrator partial failure before re-releasing.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2-2025"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 50423, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01MqjfQeQMVqU54n1ftaqoD3", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2-2025", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 50423, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01MqjfQeQMVqU54n1ftaqoD3", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 53015, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_012S2Tg9RRftdsoXo3vYMFJ2", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy - rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). Actions taken: rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0, the most recent production release that was healthy (v2.3.1-rc was only in staging and was also unhealthy). The first rollback attempt halted with a partial failure after us-east (orchestrator error), leaving us-east on v2.3.0 and us-west/eu-west on v2.3.1. I retried the rollback to v2.3.0, which completed in all regions. Current state: us-east, us-west, eu-west all on v2.3.0, healthy=true, error rate 0.002. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure root cause and the orchestrator partial failure before re-releasing.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2-2025"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 53615, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_012S2Tg9RRftdsoXo3vYMFJ2", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2-2025", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53615, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_012S2Tg9RRftdsoXo3vYMFJ2", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 56339, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions, and it is healthy again (error rate 0.002). I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n- **Rollback target:** v2.3.0 was the most recent production release that was healthy. v2.3.1 is unhealthy, and v2.3.1-rc only ran in staging.\n- **Partial failure:** The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving us-east on v2.3.0 and us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1. I retried the same rollback, and it completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** The first incident request timed out. I retried with the same idempotency key, and it returned INC-0001 once. The summary covers the rollback, the partial failure and retry, and the follow-up work.\n\nFollow-up for the team: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial failure before releasing v2.3.1 again.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01SG6SorLZjbJAfGywushUWF", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_016aCPREpAdmjdfeZipuTVSs", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0 (seq 1). v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production, and v2.3.1-rc only ran in staging. I'll roll back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_019q4DGRqctypvmz4t3dptjt", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback reported a partial failure, halted after us-east. I'll check the current state before doing anything else.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01ApgTgJjU9CSLaDKA5tprmw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "us-east is now on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. I'll retry the same rollback to finish the remaining regions.", "ty